{"id":18,"titleZh":"伊戈尔·斯特拉文斯基生日快乐","titleEn":"Happy Birthday, Igor Stravinsky","date":"1962-03-26","dateZh":"1962 年 3 月 26 日","concepts":"三次创作转型、彼得鲁什卡和弦、双拍与双调性并置","thesis":"斯特拉文斯基一生在“狂野俄式大乐队—精巧新古典—十二音序列”之间连换三次画风，但每首曲子依然听得出强烈的个人签名。","plain":"为祝贺斯特拉文斯基 80 岁寿辰，伯恩斯坦把他与同龄毕加索的多次风格剧变相提并论。早期《火鸟》《春之祭》震天动地，中期却掉头回归巴赫般的节制平衡，晚年又投身严谨的十二音技法；整集后半重点拆解《彼得鲁什卡》，看他如何用两个冲突的调性撕开木偶的灵魂。","scenes":["现场并列举出毕加索不同年代的三幅人物肖像，随后乐团依次对比《春之祭》《敦巴顿橡树园》与《阿贡》片段，直观感受三度转型。","分幕演解《彼得鲁什卡》：先分别单独演示街头手摇风琴与八音盒华尔兹，再让两组同时撞在一起演奏；第二幕让两支单簧管分别只吹 C 大调与 F 升大调形成撕裂的“彼得鲁什卡和弦”。"],"category":"大师与杰作","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1rT4y137YH","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1rT4y137YH","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 生日快乐，伊戈尔·斯特拉文斯基","duration":"54:03","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/happy-birthday-igor-stravinsky","repertoire":[{"composer":"Stravinsky","piece":"Greeting Prelude (Happy Birthday)","titleZh":"祝贺前奏曲（生日快乐）","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Stravinsky%20Greeting%20Prelude+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Stravinsky%20Greeting%20Prelude"},{"composer":"Stravinsky","piece":"The Rite of Spring","titleZh":"春之祭","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview115/v4/7b/88/f6/7b88f6ae-5897-ae55-9023-e735c2a7b016/mzaf_5094153518935407643.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/the-rite-of-spring-revised-version-for/881240687?i=881240693&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Los Angeles Philharmonic & Esa-Pekka Salonen","recordingTrack":"The Rite of Spring (Revised Version for Orchestra, Published 1947), Pt. 1 \"The Adoration of the Earth\": I. Introduction","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Stravinsky%20The%20Rite%20of%20Spring+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Stravinsky%20The%20Rite%20of